<title>USA: National Energy Group issues $100 mln debt.</title>
<headline>National Energy Group issues $100 mln debt.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1996-10-29</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following 144a private placement debt issue from National Energy Group Inc was priced late on Monday, according to a high-yield market source.</p>
<p>Bear Stearns &amp; Co is lead manager on the deal.</p>
<p>BORROWER NATIONAL ENERGY GROUP INC</p>
<p>AMT $100 MLN	  COUPON 10.750 PCT MATURITY 11/01/2006</p>
<p>TYPE SENIOR NOTES   ISS PRICE 100.00  FIRST PAY DATE 05/01/97</p>
<p>LAST MOODY B1	 YIELD 10.750 PCT  PAY FREQ SEMI-ANNUAL</p>
<p>LAST S&amp;P SINGLE-B   SPREAD 420 BP     CALLABLE NON-CALL FIVE</p>
<p>NOTES THREE YEAR EQUITY CALL FOR $35 MILLION AT 110.75 U.S. corporate bond unit, 212-859-1672</p>
</text>
